  "findings": {
    "REC5C-F1": "Diagnostic selection chose global newest outcome before ledger correlation. Two initial REDs reproduce hidden outstanding failures; now ledger-selected pairs validated before deterministic sorting.",
    "REC5C-F2": "Readable accounting was called running; context-return printed Run complete with pending work. Spec REDs and final progress cases require observed/unknown-writer state and saved completion marker.",
    "REC5C-F3": "Current locks contain no matching process creation/boot identity. No stronger writer state is invented. PID samples use signal-free pidfd/zero-time Windows handle queries and explicit unavailable outcomes.",
    "REC5C-F4": "Genuine Windows native final seal keys use platform separators. Initial positive control failed; accept only complete exact known Windows or POSIX key mappings, preserving hashes/writer bytes.",
    "REC5C-F5": "Actual temp-copy REDs accepted final summary redirected to generation answers, and wrong final release/tasks hashes. Bind exact sealed final artifact/selected release/stage0 task identity.",
    "REC5C-F6": "Copied physical owner IDs inflated totals; extra/partial owner directories and orphan/noncanonical completion records could be ignored. Exact original population and distinct run IDs now fail closed.",
    "REC5C-F7": "Initial strict diagnostic-map integration turned legal plain ledger IDs into unavailable accounting. Filter only sidecar-inapplicable IDs; preserve their financial states. A separately reproduced CLI-wrapper sibling bug receives the same codec-boundary correction.",
    "REC5C-F8": "Original helper raw Windows-path output assertion could be vacuous against JSON escaping. Strengthened final test compares escaped fragments; full suite covers it. Its interrupted partial focused rerun is retained, not claimed green.",
    "REC5C-F9": "Default lock state falsely said absent when a missing/unreadable root could not be observed. Two runnable REDs close with explicit unavailable; old no-authorization CLI-watch call shape retained after first full-suite failure."
  },
